                                        "entry_id": "a79ad5cc-5210-3f6d-8a3c-f76ddefabb84",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of hunting dog from Russia."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b222b628-0efe-4fde-a9ed-51e446239542",
                                                "sense_id": "0db8ccff-546a-3c4e-bb5a-caa1abb21b0c",
                                                "text": "Q—The Russians picked a laika to occupy the space capsule. Do you think a dachshund would have been a wiser choice?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a51a236-61a8-490e-b523-55c471c31507",
                                                "sense_id": "0db8ccff-546a-3c4e-bb5a-caa1abb21b0c",
                                                "text": "Indeed, they have been hybridising for a very long time, as is evidenced by the laika, a wolf-like dog that even today accompanies various Siberian peoples."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
